fact WorkItem(
  id: "WI-011",
  description: "M11.P3 — LocalTxSubmission driver + BackupSource.LocalNode. Implements the LocalTxSubmission state machine (Idle/Busy/Done) over the N2C mux; SubmitError gains RejectReason.Cbor(bytes, era) for raw rejection bytes (typed decomposition deferred). New BackupSource.LocalNode(socketPath, network) variant; engine submit goes via the local node when this backup is configured. Connection-share with ChainSyncSource.N2C when both point at the same socket. Tests: state-machine unit + yaci submit-and-confirm integration. Depends on WI-009 (M11.P1).",
  acceptance: [ToolPasses("cargo-test")],
